<title>BELGIUM: Eu raises some distant wheat import duties.</title>
<headline>Eu raises some distant wheat import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union said on Friday it had raised distant import duty on high quality wheat to 24.14 Ecus per tonne from 22.89 Ecus, and the duty on low-quality wheat to 51.59 Ecus from 50.27.</p>
<p>It said it had cut the distant import duty on medium quality wheat to 29.62 Ecus from 29.73 and raised the duty on maize to 75.92 from 75.85.</p>
</text>
